{"id":"89b10fd8e1240dc5","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-set-formula-relativization.md","title":"集合公式向新变量的全量词相对化","display":"df-set-formula-relativization — 集合公式向新变量的全量词相对化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-set-formula-relativization","aliases":["72-df-set-formula-relativization"],"display":"df-set-formula-relativization — 集合公式向新变量的全量词相对化","depends_on":["[[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.2 paragraph following Definition1.2.1, print216/PDF228","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"structural recursion, freshness and boundedness checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-set-formula-relativization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-set-formula-relativization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-formula-relativization — 集合公式向新变量的全量词相对化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"676fecd09411613c\" href=\"?note=676fecd09411613c\" title=\"72-df-set-theory-syntax\">72-df-set-theory-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.2 paragraph following Definition1.2.1, print216/PDF228"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"structural recursion, freshness and boundedness checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\in\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\in\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{av}_s(A)\">\\(z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{av}_s(A)\\)</span>；语法与受限量词取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"676fecd09411613c\" href=\"?note=676fecd09411613c\" title=\"72-df-set-theory-syntax\">72-df-set-theory-syntax</a>。所有递归子式沿用同一个 z，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 遍历原子及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP^{[z]}&amp;:=P,\\quad(\\neg A)^{[z]}:=\\neg A^{[z]},\\quad\n(A\\circ B)^{[z]}:=A^{[z]}\\circ B^{[z]}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall xA)^{[z]}&amp;:=(\\forall x\\in_s z)A^{[z]},\\qquad\n(\\exists xA)^{[z]}:=(\\exists x\\in_s z)A^{[z]}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP^{[z]}&amp;:=P,\\quad(\\neg A)^{[z]}:=\\neg A^{[z]},\\quad\n(A\\circ B)^{[z]}:=A^{[z]}\\circ B^{[z]}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall xA)^{[z]}&amp;:=(\\forall x\\in_s z)A^{[z]},\\qquad\n(\\exists xA)^{[z]}:=(\\exists x\\in_s z)A^{[z]}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A^{[z]}\\in\\Delta^s_0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A^{[z]})\\subseteq\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\\{z\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A^{[z]}\\in\\Delta^s_0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A^{[z]})\\subseteq\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\\{z\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将全部对象量词限制到 z。要求 z 不在全部出现变量中，而不是仅不自由出现，以避免原量词捕获新增的边界参数。递归对每个原始量词添加边界，严格下降到子式；输出由有界宏构成。已有的受限量词先按宏展开，相对化后多加的边界限制在通常传递集合语境下有相应语义；本定义不以此直观替代逐式构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-set-theory-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"676fecd09411613c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-set-theory-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"676fecd09411613c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\in$，$z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{av}_s(A)$；语法与受限量词取 [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]。所有递归子式沿用同一个 z，$P$ 遍历原子及 $\\top,\\bot$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\operatorname{av}_s(A)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\top,\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP^{[z]}&:=P,\\quad(\\neg A)^{[z]}:=\\neg A^{[z]},\\quad\n(A\\circ B)^{[z]}:=A^{[z]}\\circ B^{[z]}\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall xA)^{[z]}&:=(\\forall x\\in_s z)A^{[z]},\\qquad\n(\\exists xA)^{[z]}:=(\\exists x\\in_s z)A^{[z]}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A^{[z]}\\in\\Delta^s_0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A^{[z]})\\subseteq\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)\\cup\\{z\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1876,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]]